                                    "id": "7ecb9286-bbdb-445b-ad7f-9a4df1b2579c",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "There's still a\ncity to explore,\njobs to take, and\nproperty to fix\nup. Slush keeps",
                                        "his umbrella. Dot\nkeeps the pencil.\nPip leaves the\ndesk lamp on, with\na blank fault form",
                                        "beside it. Someone\nwill need it."
                                      ],
