                                          "args": {}
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "id": "ad0ae949-2f55-470a-a5d1-761d6f6163d3",
                                          "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "The first upgrades\nreach the clinic,\nthen the drafty\nhomes on the",
                                              "sheltered circuit.\nA nurse reports\nthat patients have\nstopped",
                                              "wearing their\noutdoor coats in\nbed. Pip pins that\nsentence above the",
                                              "garage desk. It is\nbetter than his\nspeech. Moxie\ncarries a repair",
                                              "note from a\nresident who has\nalso packed\nbiscuits. Rivet\nlogs the",
                                              "note before\nopening the tin.\nDot checks the\nfirst week of\nreadings",
                                              "and finds a small\nfault, reported\nearly and fixed\nwithout a citywide",
                                              "stop. Slush lends\nhis roof crew and\nreceives an\nordinary invoice",
                                              "marked paid. He\nlooks almost\ndisappointed that\nnobody wants a",
                                              "portrait of him\nholding a hammer.\nNib offers him a\nbiscuit instead.",
                                              "There is still\nwork to do, and\nyou can keep\nexploring, taking\njobs,",
                                              "or making another\nproperty worth\ncoming home to.\nFor tonight,\npeople",
                                              "have taken their\ncoats off. The\ncity has given\nthem a reason to",
                                              "stay."
                                            ],
                                            "avatarId": "",
                                            "minHeight": 4,
                                            "maxHeight": 7,
                                            "position": "bottom",
                                            "closeWhen": "key",
                                            "closeButton": "a"
                                          }
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "id": "896bf921-3a56-4721-ad2e-8584ae354841",
                                          "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                                          "args": {}
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  }
                                ],
                                "false": [
                                  {
                                    "id": "4aba2aa2-fff7-4c26-ae08-edfa237cda6c",
